% SECTION IV: PROPOSED METHOD
% =========================================
\section{Proposed Future-Aware PPO Agent}
\label{sec:method}
Our proposed agent utilizes the Proximal Policy Optimization (PPO) algorithm.
\subsection{State Space}
The state $s_t$ includes:
\begin{itemize}
    \item Past throughput observations ($x_t$).
    \item Current buffer level ($B_t$).
    \item \textbf{Future Awareness:} Size of the next chunk $C_{k+1}$ and its VMAF score.
\end{itemize}
\subsection{Reward Function}
The reward function is augmented with the Lyapunov penalty derived in Section III:
\begin{equation}
r_t = QoE_t - \beta \cdot \max(0, B_{ref} - B_t)^2
\end{equation}
where $\beta$ is a tunable parameter controlling the strength of the stability constraint.
